+ * @file failsafe_student_test.cpp
+ *
+ * Student-authored structural test suite for FailsafeBase (v1.17.0).
+ * Implemented by Student 2 from the structural test basis and MC/DC analysis
+ * developed in Parts 1 and 2 (TC-FS-01 through TC-FS-27).
